		(property "Description" "The 74AHCT1G125 is a single non-inverting buffer/bus driver with a 3-state output. The output enters a high impedance state when a HIGH-level is applied to the output enable (OE) pin. The device is designed for operation with a power supply range of 4.5V to 5.5V."
